# 💬 Real-Time MERN Chat Application (PulseChat)

![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-20232A?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=61DAFB)
![Node.js](https://img.shields.io/badge/Node.js-339933?style=for-the-badge&logo=nodedotjs&logoColor=white)
![MongoDB](https://img.shields.io/badge/MongoDB-4EA94B?style=for-the-badge&logo=mongodb&logoColor=white)
![Socket.io](https://img.shields.io/badge/Socket.io-010101?style=for-the-badge&logo=socketdotio&logoColor=white)
![Tailwind](https://img.shields.io/badge/Tailwind_CSS-38B2AC?style=for-the-badge&logo=tailwind-css&logoColor=white)
![Status](https://img.shields.io/badge/Status-Active-success)

A full-stack, real-time messaging application built with the MERN stack (MongoDB, Express.js, React, Node.js). Featuring a modern Glassmorphism UI, this application supports real-time one-on-one messaging, WhatsApp-style double-tick status (`✓✓`), audio notifications & toast alerts, group chats, image sharing, user profile management, and 1-click guest access.

---

## 🔑 Demo / Guest Credentials

Want to quickly test out the application without signing up? Use the pre-configured guest credentials below or click the **"🚀 Login as Guest User"** button directly on the login screen!

